Package: clustPear
Type: Package
Title: Cluster-Weighted Pearson Correlations with Subgroup-Aware Estimators
Version: 0.1.3
Authors@R: person("Package", "Maintainer", email = "maintainer@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Estimates ordinary pooled, cluster-weighted, quantile-grid, and
    rank-averaged Pearson correlations from paired clustered observations.
    Reports independent-cluster sandwich standard errors, and optional
    design-based Taylor-linearized standard errors and confidence intervals
    using full person-level stratified/clustered survey designs.
    Quantile-grid and rank-averaged inference treats empirical cutpoints
    as fixed. Includes a compact clustered-data simulator.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: Rcpp (>= 1.0.0), stats, tibble
LinkingTo: Rcpp
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), survey (>= 4.1)
SystemRequirements: C++17
NeedsCompilation: yes
Config/testthat/edition: 3
